### Field Inventory + Re-compress on Learn

基于上述发现，实现两个改进：

#### Feature 1: Field Inventory Hint

压缩输出现在附带省略字段清单：

```
[{"number":142,"state":"open","title":"Add dark mode support"}, ...]

[Harbor: 3/20 fields shown. Omitted: assignee, body, closed_at, comments, ...
 To include omitted fields, call harbor_learn_schema with updated summary_fields.]
```

agent 从"不知道自己不知道"变成"知道自己少了什么"。成本 ~50 bytes。

#### Feature 2: Re-compress on Schema Update

`harbor_learn_schema` 现在从内存缓存取 raw 数据，用新 schema 重压缩并直接返回：

```
Schema learned for "list_issues" (version 2, fields: [number title state user assignee]).
Re-compressed cached data:
[{"assignee":"bob","number":142,...,"user":"alice"}, ...]
```

agent 一次调用就拿到更新后的数据，省去一次工具 round-trip。

