|------|------|
| `internal/proxy/handler.go` | +`buildFieldInventory()`, +`detectAllFields()`, +`recompressCached()`；`makeLearnHandler` 加 memStore 参数 |
| `internal/proxy/proxy.go` | 更新 `makeLearnHandler` 调用传 memStore |
| `internal/proxy/e2e_test.go` | +`TestE2EFieldInventory`, +`TestE2ERecompressOnLearn`；修复已有测试适配 inventory |
